+++ b/mm/Kconfig
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
-menu "Memory Management options"
+config HBF_CONTROL_PLANE
+	tristate "Experimental HBF-like memory tier hint control plane"
+	depends on MMU
+	help
+	  Enable an experimental mm-facing control plane for HBF-like warm
+	  capacity exposed through CXL Type-3, DAX, or memory hotplug.
+
+	  This is an RFC skeleton only. It validates hint ranges and provides an
+	  optional RFC frontend, but it does not implement real migration or
+	  backend execution.
 
